# Data backups. THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. Backups taken before a data edit hold the
# PRE-correction rows, so a removed business name or phone number lives on
# inside them. Three such files sat untracked here until 2026-07-30, one commit
# away from being published permanently by a stray `git add -A`. Keep backups
# outside the repo (Automation & Operations\sync\data-backups\); this rule is
# the second line of defence, not the first.
*.bak-*
*.bak
